the predicates are:
    the kb name is *a name*.
    the current rule id is *an id*.

the knowledge base prolog_test includes:
    rule my_kb_rule:
    the kb name is *a name* if
        prolog (le_my_kb(KM), KM:le_kb(the name)).

    rule my_id_rule:
    the current rule id is *an id* if
        prolog le_my_id(the id).

scenario test is:
    one expects answers ["the kb name is prolog_test"].
    two expects answers ["the current rule id is my_id_rule"].

query one is:
    the kb name is *what*.

query two is:
    the current rule id is *what*.
